 154→### Normalizing Points and Relative Bounding Box
 155→
 156→```vex
 157→@P = normalize(@P);
 158→
 159→vector bbox = relpointbbox(0, @P);
 160→@Cd = bbox.y;
 161→```
 162→
 163→Normalizes point positions to create a spherical distribution, then uses relpointbbox() to get the relative position of each point within the geometry's bounding box.
